## Project CLI

All project CLI commands are invoked via:

```bash
cd backend
uv run {{ project_slug }} <group> <command> [options]
```

### Server Commands

```bash
uv run {{ project_slug }} server run              # Start dev server
uv run {{ project_slug }} server run --reload     # With hot reload
uv run {{ project_slug }} server run --port 9000  # Custom port
uv run {{ project_slug }} server routes           # Show all registered routes
```


### Database Commands

```bash
uv run {{ project_slug }} db init                  # Run all migrations
uv run {{ project_slug }} db migrate -m "message"  # Create new migration
uv run {{ project_slug }} db upgrade               # Apply pending migrations
uv run {{ project_slug }} db upgrade --revision e3f  # Upgrade to specific revision
uv run {{ project_slug }} db downgrade             # Rollback last migration
uv run {{ project_slug }} db downgrade --revision base  # Rollback to start
uv run {{ project_slug }} db current               # Show current revision
uv run {{ project_slug }} db history               # Show migration history
```

{%- if use_jwt %}

### User Commands

```bash
# Create user (interactive prompts for email/password)
uv run {{ project_slug }} user create

# Create user non-interactively
uv run {{ project_slug }} user create --email user@example.com --password secret

# Create user with specific role
uv run {{ project_slug }} user create --email admin@example.com --password secret --role admin

# Create user with superuser flag
uv run {{ project_slug }} user create --email admin@example.com --password secret --superuser

# Create admin (shortcut)
uv run {{ project_slug }} user create-admin --email admin@example.com --password secret

# Change user role
uv run {{ project_slug }} user set-role user@example.com --role admin

# List all users
uv run {{ project_slug }} user list
```
{%- endif %}

